#: includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:604
msgid "Automatically detects installed cookie banners and blocks browser and CAPI events until consent is given. Supports Must Have Plugins Cookie Bar, Borlabs Cookie, Complianz, Real Cookie Banner, CookieYes, Cookiebot, SureCookies and any banner using the WP Consent API. Automatic blocking cannot be guaranteed for unlisted third-party banners. Sites without a cookie banner are never blocked."
